  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/h0bSBTU.png\" alt=\"Benched 橫幅\" width=\"1903\" height=\"951\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Benched</strong> 加入了獨特的 <strong>野餐長椅</strong>！</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">野餐長椅的尺寸為 2x2，只需右鍵點擊即可坐在上面！你也可以在長椅上放置物品！</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://imgur.com/9Xh8KmD.png\" alt=\"Benched 分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/o557rZJ.png\" alt=\"金合歡木野餐長椅\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">&nbsp;金合歡木野餐長椅</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/s3DdOvG.png\" alt=\"金合歡木野餐長椅合成圖\" width=\"350\" height=\"183\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/4cA25LP.png\" alt=\"白樺木野餐長椅\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">&nbsp;白樺木野餐長椅</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/bSC2YjD.png\" alt=\"白樺木野餐長椅合成圖\" width=\"350\" height=\"183\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/kNCPjEM.png\" alt=\"深色橡木野餐長椅\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">&nbsp;深色橡木野餐長椅</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/zP1KfN1.png\" alt=\"深色橡木野餐長椅合成圖\" width=\"350\" height=\"183\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/hpNnXpB.png\" alt=\"叢林木野餐長椅\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">&nbsp;叢林木野餐長椅</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/dkZGlNO.png\" alt=\"叢林木野餐長椅\" width=\"350\" height=\"183\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Z8nD3UF.png\" alt=\"橡木野餐長椅\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">&nbsp;橡木野餐長椅</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/CS2Tf4o.png\" alt=\"野餐長椅合成圖\" width=\"350\" height=\"183\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/lR5h4bF.png\" alt=\"雲杉木野餐長椅\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">&nbsp;雲杉木野餐長椅</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/NeOEwLN.png\" alt=\"雲杉木野餐長椅合成圖\" width=\"350\" height=\"187\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/TccrptN.png\" alt=\"緋紅木野餐長椅\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"> 緋紅木野餐長椅</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/0d6gr6F.png\" alt=\"緋紅木野餐長椅合成圖\" width=\"350\" height=\"183\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Q3GdQ67.png\" alt=\"诡异木野餐長椅\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">&nbsp;诡异木野餐長椅</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/avY6zJX.png\" alt=\"诡异木野餐長椅合成圖\" width=\"350\" height=\"183\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/9Xh8KmD.png\" alt=\"Benched 分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/6Ygx045.png\" alt=\"Benched 圖片\" width=\"711\" height=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/9Xh8KmD.png\" alt=\"Benched 分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>常見問題</strong></h3>\n<h4><strong>我可以在我的整合包中使用你的模組嗎？</strong></h4>\n<h5>可以，歡迎在你的整合包中使用我的模組。</h5>\n<h4><strong>你可以坐在長椅上嗎？</strong></h4>\n<h5>可以，只需右鍵點擊長椅即可坐下。</h5>\n<h4><strong>你可以在長椅上放置物品嗎？</strong></h4>\n<h5>可以，手持物品右鍵點擊長椅即可放置。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/9Xh8KmD.png\" alt=\"Benched 分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>Discord</strong></h3>\n<h5>想要獲取未來內容、即將推出的模組資訊以及參與討論，歡迎加入 SuperMartijn642 的 Discord 伺服器！</h5>\n<h5><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" width=\"373\" height=\"93\"></a></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/9Xh8KmD.png\" alt=\"Benched 分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://imgur.com/bA5x3eg.png\" alt=\"野餐長椅\" width=\"266\" height=\"266\">&nbsp;</p>",
